{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a91e532b-67df-485a-93f9-7157a5eb23b0",
    "name": "End Security - Backend API",
    "description": "Una petición por endpoint, agrupadas por módulo.\n\nOrden para probar una cuenta nueva: Auth → Registro → (copia el código en emailCode) → Confirmar código de correo → Usuario, Bóveda, Auditoría, Cambio de correo → Auth → Logout.\n\nSi email está vacío se genera uno aleatorio. Para recibir el código con Resend, escribe en email el correo de tu cuenta de Resend antes de Registro.\n\nLos valores criptográficos son bytes de prueba en base64; la app Android los obtiene con Argon2id y AES-256-GCM.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('email')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('email', `qa+${Date.now()}@endsecurity.test`);",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "General",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Comprueba que la API y PostgreSQL responden.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Prelogin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/prelogin",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "prelogin"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Parámetros Argon2id del correo. Para correos inexistentes responde con valores por defecto (no revela si la cuenta existe).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Registro",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('challengeToken', pm.response.json().data.challengeToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('emailCode', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea la cuenta sin sesión y envía el código de verificación al correo (o a la consola de la API si no hay RESEND_API_KEY). Guarda el challengeToken.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"Diego Pruebas\",\n  \"authHash\": \"{{authHash}}\",\n  \"kdf\": {\n    \"salt\": \"{{kdfSalt}}\",\n    \"memoryKib\": 65536,\n    \"iterations\": 3,\n    \"parallelism\": 4\n  },\n  \"pvk\": {\n    \"ciphertext\": \"{{pvkCiphertext}}\",\n    \"nonce\": \"{{pvkNonce}}\"\n  },\n  \"deviceName\": \"Postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar código de correo",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('emailCode')) {",
                  "  console.log('Falta la variable emailCode: copia el código del correo o de la consola de la API.');",
                  "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const tokens = pm.response.json().data.tokens;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', tokens.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('emailCode', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/verify/confirm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "email",
                "verify",
                "confirm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifica el correo e inicia la sesión. Antes, copia el código recibido en la variable emailCode.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"challengeToken\": \"{{challengeToken}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{emailCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reenviar código",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/verify/resend",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "email",
                "verify",
                "resend"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envía un código nuevo (mínimo 60 s entre envíos; antes responde 429).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"challengeToken\": \"{{challengeToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "if (data.requiresEmailVerification) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('challengeToken', data.challengeToken);",
                  "  console.log('Correo sin verificar: copia el código en emailCode y ejecuta Confirmar código de correo.');",
                  "} else if (data.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Con el correo verificado entrega tokens. Sin verificar responde requiresEmailVerification y un challengeToken; en ese caso usa Confirmar código de correo.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"authHash\": \"{{authHash}}\",\n  \"deviceName\": \"Postman\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Renueva el access token. El refresh token rota en cada uso; si se reutiliza uno viejo, la sesión se revoca.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cierra la sesión actual. Ejecútalo al final: después, el access token deja de servir."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuario",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Perfil",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Perfil de la cuenta autenticada."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bóveda",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Descargar cambios",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('revision', pm.response.json().data.revision);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vault/sync?since={{revision}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "vault",
                "sync"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "since",
                  "value": "{{revision}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Elementos cambiados después de la revisión since (0 = bóveda completa). Guarda la revisión actual."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar cambios",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('itemId')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('itemId', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('itemVersion', '0');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('itemVersion', String(data.applied[0].version));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('revision', data.revision);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/vault/sync",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "vault",
                "sync"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea o edita un elemento cifrado. La primera vez usa baseVersion 0 (alta); después la colección guarda la versión y cada envío es una edición. Para borrarlo, cambia el cuerpo a { \"id\", \"baseVersion\", \"deleted\": true }.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"{{itemId}}\",\n      \"baseVersion\": {{itemVersion}},\n      \"nonce\": \"{{itemNonce}}\",\n      \"ciphertext\": \"{{itemCiphertext}}\",\n      \"formatVersion\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditoría",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Historial",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/audit?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "audit"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Eventos de seguridad de la cuenta, del más reciente al más viejo. Página siguiente: ?before=<nextCursor>."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verificar cadena",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Cadena íntegra', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.valid).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/audit/verify",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "audit",
                "verify"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Recalcula la cadena de HMAC. valid: false indica que alguien alteró o borró filas de audit_log."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Cambio de correo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Solicitar cambio",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('newEmail')) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('newEmail', `qa+nuevo${Date.now()}@endsecurity.test`);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('emailChangeCode', '');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/change/request",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "email",
                "change",
                "request"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pide la contraseña maestra (authHash) y envía un código al correo nuevo. Con Resend sin dominio verificado, pruébalo en modo consola.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"newEmail\": \"{{newEmail}}\",\n  \"authHash\": \"{{authHash}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar cambio",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('emailChangeCode')) {",
                  "  console.log('Falta la variable emailChangeCode: copia el código que llegó al correo nuevo o a la consola.');",
                  "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Responde 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('email', pm.response.json().data.email);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('newEmail', '');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('emailChangeCode', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/email/change/confirm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "email",
                "change",
                "confirm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cambia el correo y cierra las demás sesiones. Antes, copia el código en la variable emailChangeCode.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{emailChangeCode}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
